silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_01_sections_01_concrete_anchor_apex a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "ConcreteAnchorMittensApexExample" .
silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_01_sections_01_concrete_anchor_apex silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchorMittensApex', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, The single governed individual: the cat asleep on the radiator. Mittens is the same cat on 2026-04-12 (vet visit), 2026-04-19 (microchip read), and 2026-04-26 (dietary card). Mittens is NOT the union of all records about Mittens; it is the colimit apex of the directed system of source diagrams.." .
